# Frontend brauzeridan backend API'ga so'rov yuboradigan manzil.
#
# Hozir BO'SH — Vite dev proxy /api/* so'rovlarini avtomatik
# `http://localhost:3001` ga uzatadi (vite.config.ts).
# Bu degani: telefon faqat frontend URL'iga (5173 yoki ngrok tunnel)
# kirsa kifoya. Backend telefon uchun alohida ko'rinishi shart emas.
#
# Production deploy paytida bu yerga publik backend URL yozasiz, masalan:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://hearak-api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
